box "🏆 Final Recommendation Ranking (Top 3)" #D4EDDA
  1️⃣  Dr. De Chavez - Score: **85** ✅ BEST RECOMMENDATION
  2️⃣  Dr. Aaron Bayten - Score: **77**
  3️⃣  Dr. Jimenez / Dr. Samboa - Score: **80/60**
  
  **Display Order:**
  ✅ Familiar doctor with excellent history
  ✅ Doctor with good experience
  ✅ New doctors or lower scores
end box

@enduml
